WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.800
Change the model. The plot recomputes in Julia.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.500
Ask a follow-up. Results stream into the conversation.

00:16.500 --> 00:23.300
Open the full calculation, then fold it out of the way.

00:23.400 --> 00:31.500
Move the live app into its own workspace panel.

00:31.500 --> 00:38.900
The app stays interactive beside the code and conversation.
